<title>INDONESIA: Komatsu 9-mth net soars to 33.26 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Komatsu 9-mth net soars to 33.26 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   33.26 vs 24.24</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)   245 vs 241</p>
<p>    Net sales			   394.39 vs 271.46</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   51.63 vs 40.72</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Komatsu Indonesia is a heavy equipment manufacturer.</p>
</text>
